.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828028_779487671480726_7313992097102781718_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wJZafHwbGXsQ7kNvwG5rmNF&_nc_oc=AdoY4Uvp9aUSg0bwSgf9FPHZYPP0fVD-U-Prq-rd_BECXsWm_UorJVNrb_SMCgoEjdM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8tHRdxe7z8cRFZEp55pP3QP_I57oCD1k28er5O3hn60w&oe=6A3BEE3C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Echoes of the Asylum: VR Horror Escape", "keywords": ["Horror", "Mystery", "Paranormal", "Survival", "Puzzle"], "long_description": "You are not alone.\nWhispers follow you. Shadows move when you\u2019re not looking. And something deep within this asylum doesn\u2019t want you to leave.\n\nEchoes of the Asylum: VR Horror Escape is a chilling, full-room VR experience where survival means uncovering the truth behind a forgotten nightmare.\n\nYou awaken in a derelict asylum with no memory of how you got there. As you explore, you\u2019ll find scattered map pieces, locked doors, old recordings, and ghostly clues that speak of dark experiments, lost souls, and the asylum\u2019s twisted past.\n\nEvery object you find, every echo you hear, brings you closer to freedom \u2014 or madness.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Key Features:\n\n\u2022\tImmersive VR horror escape game play designed for Meta Quest\n\u2022\tPsychological tension + paranormal threats with no cheap jump scares\n\u2022\tClever puzzle solving with multi-level exploration\n\u2022\tDiscover chilling audio logs to piece together the asylum\u2019s secrets\n\u2022\tUnlock rooms, collect clues, and fight to escape the horror before it consumes you.\n\n\nThis is more than a haunted building. It remembers.\nIt watches.\nAnd it wants you to remember too.\n\nDare to escape? Download now and experience Echoes of the Asylum in VR.", "short_description": "Haunted by echoes. Solve chilling puzzles and escape a cursed asylum in terrifying VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.engagi